ia.controls.airplane=Stick forward/back: throttle  Look: pitch and turn  Stick left/right: turn  Attack: fire  Sneak: get out
ia.controls.all=Works the same on touch, controller and keyboard. Planes: push the stick forward to raise the throttle and back to lower it (and brake on the ground); the plane pitches and turns toward where you look, and stick left/right also turns. Helicopters and airships: the stick flies forward, back and turns; look up to climb and down to descend. The gyrodyne needs you to hold forward to spin the rotor up. Attack with an empty hand to fire weapons; the telescope zooms while held. Use a firework rocket to burn the rockets in the boost slot. Sneak (or the dismount button) to get out. Tap an aircraft while holding an upgrade, weapon, banner or dye to install it; sneak + tap to install fuel or rockets, or to open the inventory. Tap a damaged aircraft to repair it. /ia:aircraft opens this panel.
